// F1DB circuit id → f1-circuits GeoJSON feature id.
//
// The two datasets name circuits differently (F1DB says 'spa-francorchamps', the
// GeoJSON says 'be-1925'), so this bridges them. Generated by matching each track
// outline's centroid to the nearest F1DB circuit — every pair landed within about
// a kilometre, and all 40 were checked by eye.
//
// One manual correction: the modern Las Vegas Strip circuit's centroid falls closer
// to the 1981–82 Caesars Palace car-park layout than to F1DB's own Las Vegas
// coordinate, so it is pinned here rather than matched.
//
// Track outlines: github.com/bacinger/f1-circuits (MIT), © 2019–2025 Tomislav Bacinger.

